graph TD
A[Start / System self-checks<br/>(balance, cameras, lights, dial gauge, comms)] --> B[Place blade on balance fixture]
  B --> C{Balance stable?}
  C -- No --> C
  C -- Yes --> D[Trigger multi-illumination capture<br/>(cycle lights; capture from all cameras)]
  D --> E[OCR alphanumeric ID<br/>(text + confidence + crop image)]
  E --> F[Record stabilized weight from balance]
  F --> G[HMI prompt: move blade to dial gauge]
  G --> H{Dial gauge stable?}
  H -- No --> H
  H -- Yes --> I[Capture dial gauge reading]
  I --> J[Review screen: ID (w/ confidence), weight, dial reading + images]
  J --> K{Operator accepts?}
  K -- No --> L[Re-acquire step(s) or flag for rework]
  L --> J
  K -- Yes --> M[Save to spreadsheet + archive images + log metadata]

  M --> N[End / Next blade] 	 
